{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07533","headline":"杂诗六首 一 · 李华","name":"杂诗六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄锺扣元音，律吕更循环。\n邪气悖正声，郑卫生其间。\n典乐忽涓微，波浪与天浑。\n嘈嘈鸱枭动，好鸟徒緜蛮。\n王吉归乡里，甘心长闭关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}